OL,3,GNEWSAStarlink broadband pilot targets
OL,4,Arural 'not spots'
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk's Starlink satellite system
OL,7,Fis set to be used to improve farmers'
OL,8,Fbroadband connections during a pilot
OL,9,Fscheme.
OL,11,FLincolnshire County Council said it
OL,12,Fwanted to purchase and install Starlink
OL,13,Ffacilities for so-called "not spot"
OL,14,Fproperties that do not have access to
OL,15,Ffibre broadband.
OL,17,FThe council owns a County Farms Estate,
OL,18,Fcomprising about 16,500 acres and 149
OL,19,Fholdings for tenants.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
