OL,3,GNEWSAStarlink broadband pilot targets
OL,4,Arural 'not spots'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Lock, executive councillor for the
OL,7,Feconomy, said: "This pilot will help us
OL,8,Fsee whether satellite broadband could
OL,9,Foffer a real practical solution for
OL,10,Ffarms and other rural businesses that
OL,11,Fstruggle with poor connectivity."
